4. Simplified the session mocking approach

The error occurred because we were trying to use Jest's spyOn method which isn't available in this context. The new approach uses direct module override which should work in this environment.

The component should now receive the correct query parameters and context it needs to render properly. All the necessary mocks are still in place but implemented in a way that doesn't require Jest.

